      <tei:div type="introduction">
        <tei:p>A note for using this prayer. Eight qualities are mentioned in the prayer: Peace, Blessing, Hope, Return, Promise, Strength, Life, Courage. You can pick one to focus on each night. (You can do them in the order they appear in if you like.) Where do you find that quality in you? Where do you find it in the world? What will a life, or a world, transformed by that quality look like? Feel like?</tei:p>
      </tei:div>
      <j:endConditional target="#osp_59374_introduction"/>
